      "statement": "lib/airtable/cached.ts caches the engine context in an in-memory, per-module-instance cache with a 5-minute TTL instead of Next's unstable_cache, because the full context (~9.4K history rows plus ~3.2K catalog items) serializes past unstable_cache's 2 MB entry limit, which previously caused runtime 500s on Vercel.",
      "evidence": [
